      <title>Neel Kashkari at the Aspen Ideas Festival 2026</title>
      <decription>&lt;p&gt;Minneapolis Fed President Neel Kashkari participates in a panel discussion at the Aspen Ideas Festival 2026 entitled “Affordability—What's Real About What We Feel?” in Aspen, Colorado. The discussion is moderated by Lisa Abramowicz, co-host of Bloomberg Surveillance on Bloomberg Television. &lt;/p&gt;</decription>
      <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 15:29:11 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
